# RAGraph — Agent Operational Rules

## CONTEXT HARNESSING

At the start of ANY task, you MUST read `harness/project.md`, `harness/process.md`, and `harness/progress.md`.

## STATE UPDATE

Before completing ANY task, you MUST update `harness/progress.md` and check off completed items in `harness/process.md`.

## DECISIONS

Propose updates to `harness/decision.md` ONLY for major architectural changes, significant dependency shifts, or core logic definitions (e.g., Agent orchestration logic). Do NOT log minor bug fixes or routine code generation here.

## LANGUAGE RULE

ALL code, docstrings, inline comments, and commit messages MUST BE EXCLUSIVELY IN ENGLISH. NO EXCEPTIONS. NEVER USE CHINESE CHARACTERS IN CODE.

## TESTING

TDD is mandatory. Write minimal Pytest cases before implementation.